        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“Beep—Beep—” Roxane Chantereau was woken up by the sound of incoming messages. It was early in the morning. Who was that? Only half awake, she "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for her phone."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Someone had "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Roxane a video. The video made her really "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In the video, two baby "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chimpanzees",
            "ref": "v-chimpanzee"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " were running after each other in a dirty room. A third was standing on a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dresser",
            "zh": "梳妆台"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Its arms were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over its head. The senders asked for a large "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of money. If she didn’t pay it, they would kill the animals."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Roxane is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "co-founder",
            "zh": "联合创始人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of an animal "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "shelter",
            "ref": "v-shelter"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Congo",
            "zh": "刚果"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The shelter "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a home for 40 chimpanzees and 64 monkeys. They had all been "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "illegal",
            "ref": "v-illegal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " animal trade. Roxane "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "immediately",
            "ref": "v-immediately"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the chimpanzees in the video. They were from her shelter. She "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "had no choice but to",
            "ref": "v-no-choice-but-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " report the case to the police."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“This is the first of its "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the world,” Roxane said. “But it’s impossible to pay the money.” The case has gotten a great deal of public "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She hopes that this will make the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "criminals",
            "ref": "v-criminal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " return the animals."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
